(2026, 'mastering-sap-grc-ruleset-manager-a-complete-overview', 'Chetna Patwal', 'chetna@example.com', 'Hi Raghu,\nThank you for the post, I wanted to ask you few things and if you. Oils please guide me! When we say a nice tailored GRC ruleset for customer .. what are the nice things ? So basically what a nice GRC ruleset features of? When is a ruleset is the best ruleset ? Is it just have less false positive risks or are there other factors also? Could you pls guide', 'approved', '2026-02-10 02:37:17', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2034, 'integrating-okta-with-sap-iasips-by-raghu-boddu-step-by-step-iam-best-practices', 'Jarvis', 'jarvis@gmail.com', 'Great blog! Well articulated and the video is perfect! It helped me to do the configuration easily! Thanks!', 'approved', '2026-02-14 16:00:52', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2035, 'what-actually-optimizes-sap-licenses-star-usmm-lawslaw-explained', 'Chetan Agrawal', 'Chetan@gmail.com', 'Very well articulated l, few additional comments 1. STAR doesn’t work with non S4 systems 2. For S4 systems, It is very important &amp; recommended to ensure you have allocated role to licenses in S4 and the user licenses are auto calculated at every role assignment/ removal to ensure optimal licenses are assigned Regarding USMM, the consolidation of licenses doesn’t work very well with non standard/ custom licenses, hence an expert with user licenses comes a long way in helping the optimal uses of licenses.', 'approved', '2026-02-11 16:02:18', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2036, 'what-actually-optimizes-sap-licenses-star-usmm-lawslaw-explained', 'Paul', 'Paul@gmail.com', 'Interesting and crisp. Good one!', 'approved', '2026-02-10 16:02:41', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2038, 'sap-iag-vs-sap-grc-access-control', 'Vinod', 'vmsonimindia@gmail.com', 'Very much explanatory document', 'approved', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
